PDF Converter is a professional PDF conversion tool that supports mutual conversion between PDF and formats such as Word, Excel, and PowerPoint. The stable conversion engine ensures that there is no garbled text or content loss during the conversion process. With a clean interface design, rich file management and reading functions, it allows you to conveniently and efficiently manage, view, and process various files. The PDF file compression feature enables easy reduction of PDF file size. Additionally, users can encrypt or decrypt PDF files using password.

Key Features:
● Convert PDF to Word, Excel, PowerPoint;
● Convert Word, Excel, PowerPoint, Html to PDF;
● Compress PDF file to reduce its size;
● Encrypt/Decrypt PDF files using a password;
● Five ways to transfer files(iTunes file sharing, WiFi sharing, Document Picker, Share to other app, Download from web browser).

